@startuml
title Frequent renewal worker - one late cycle, shared core (REVIEW)
autonumber
participant "Renewal worker" as W
participant "Due subscriptions" as R
participant "Shared cycle service" as S
participant "MAIN account" as A
participant "Cycle / financial history" as L
W -> R : limited batch of due auto-renewal candidates
loop candidate
 W -> S : attempt candidate root/version/cycleKey
 S -> R : re-evaluate state, version, cancellation receipt, prior outcome
 alt cycle already made / business FAILED / cancelled
  R --> S : saved outcome / skip / conflict
 else eligible intent, no accepted/unresolved cancellation
  S -> A : DB expiry eligibility under coordination, current MAIN funds
  alt insufficient funds
   S -> R : EXPIRED + final failed attempt, no auto resurrection
  else valid
   group consistent renewal
    S -> A : deduct one current-price MAIN fee
    S -> L : one AUTO_RENEWAL_FEE + one immutable cycle
    S -> R : ACTIVE, coverageEnd/version advanced
   end
  end
 end
 S --> W : committed outcome; record progress
end
note over W,L
 Interval/batch are technical proposals, not approved60s.
 Delayed seconds/days: one new cycle starts at valid processing instant.
 No retroactive rights, no collection for all missed cycles.
 Manual purchase/JOB-01 share guards; technical failure rollback/retry bounded.
end note
@enduml
